WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:17.557
Riley: Theo! Why did you wish that?

2
00:00:17.558 --> 00:00:21.907
Theo: Because I want our club to be famous!

3
00:00:21.908 --> 00:00:25.708
Skyler: I think the Pet Lovers Club is fun now.

4
00:00:25.709 --> 00:00:28.258
Mrs. Summers: Kids, come down right now.

5
00:00:28.259 --> 00:00:31.348
Mr. Peabody just called!

6
00:00:31.349 --> 00:00:34.991
Theo: Uh-oh. The principal called?

7
00:00:34.992 --> 00:00:39.096
What did I do wrong?

8
00:00:39.097 --> 00:00:40.718
Mrs. Summers: Guess what?

9
00:00:40.719 --> 00:00:44.787
Mrs. Summers: Mr. Peabody wants to take a picture of the Pet Lovers Club.

10
00:00:44.788 --> 00:00:46.272
Sarah: Why?

11
00:00:46.273 --> 00:00:51.154
Mrs. Summers: Because tomorrow is National Pet Day.

12
00:00:51.155 --> 00:00:52.586
Ben: Cool!

13
00:00:52.587 --> 00:00:56.133
Mrs. Summers: Your picture will be in the newspaper!

14
00:00:56.134 --> 00:01:00.165
Theo: Wow! My wish is coming true.

15
00:01:00.166 --> 00:01:07.797
Mrs. Summers: Be careful what you wish for!

16
00:01:07.798 --> 00:01:11.186
Mr. Peabody: Kids, stand still please!

17
00:01:11.187 --> 00:01:14.359
Chatter: Squawk. Stand still.

18
00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:18.242
Clean up that mess! Be quiet!

19
00:01:18.243 --> 00:01:21.260
Kristen: Listen to that funny parrot!

20
00:01:21.261 --> 00:01:24.432
Jason: I wish I had a parrot like that.

21
00:01:24.433 --> 00:01:26.501
Alexia: Me too!

22
00:01:26.502 --> 00:01:30.247
Mr. Peabody: Smile, kids!

23
00:01:30.248 --> 00:01:34.441
Chatter: Smile! Smile! Smile!

24
00:01:34.442 --> 00:01:38.951
Mr. Peabody: That's a great parrot you have, Skyler.

25
00:01:38.952 --> 00:01:42.311
Jason: He's so funny!

26
00:01:42.312 --> 00:01:48.381
Alexia: And look at that hound dog!

27
00:01:48.382 --> 00:01:52.607
Snooks: Ar-ooo!

28
00:01:52.608 --> 00:01:54.926
Frankie: Ribbit! Ribbit!

29
00:01:54.927 --> 00:01:58.892
Jason: The frog is cute too.

30
00:01:58.893 --> 00:02:00.940
Mr. Peabody: One more picture.

31
00:02:00.941 --> 00:02:07.092
Mr. Peabody: I bet you'll be on the front page of the newspaper!

32
00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:12.221
Theo: The Pet Lovers Club is going to be famous!

33
00:02:12.222 --> 00:02:18.160
Riley: Theo's wish is coming true!
